  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Norsk Folkehjelp har ans&#xF6;kt om extra bidrag f&#xF6;r att kunna forts&#xE4;tta sitt arbete i tv&#xE5; flyktingl&#xE4;ger och med sin terapiverksamhet f&#xF6;r kvinnor p&#xE5; det psykosociala centret i Tuzla under 1998. Behovet av insatser i centret &#xE4;r fortfarande mycket stort.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian People&apos;s Aid has applied for extra support to be able to continue the work during 1998 at two refugee settlements and for occupational therapy for women at the psychosocial centre in Tuzla. The need of the activities in the refugee centres is still great.</narrative>
  </description>
